..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name       : VKZ.BFUSS
.. Autor          : male
.. Verantwortlich : cl
.. Kontrolle      : mh
.. Functionality  : Report footer of the Infosystem fb/VKZ
..*****************************************************************************
..
.set trans -
..
.input "fb/VKZ.SUM" ? M|grpnachstaat ; M|grpnachverd
..
.formula U|xperiod = 1
..*****************************************************************************
!LOOP
..*****************************************************************************
.continue END ? U|xperiod > M|maxperiod
.formula M|ganfsal.U|xperiod = M|asollsum.U|xperiod - M|ahabensum.U|xperiod
.formula M|vkzsal.U|xperiod  = M|vkzsollsum.U|xperiod - M|vkzhabensum.U|xperiod
.formula M|gvkzsal.U|xperiod = M|ggvkzs.U|xperiod - M|ggvkzh.U|xperiod
.formula M|gessum.U|xperiod  = M|esollsum.U|xperiod - M|ehabensum.U|xperiod
.formula U|xperiod = U|xperiod + 1
.continue LOOP
..
..*****************************************************************************
!END
..*****************************************************************************
.continue
